  "name": "Encourage Entourage",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/blood-slash-foam-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you join the College of The Idol at 3rd level, you can use your performance to cover for your allies. When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you makes an attack roll or ability check, you can use your reaction to perform, allowing them to push forward. Make a Charisma (Performance) check and replace the original attack roll or ability check with the result, unless the original was higher.</p>\n<p>You have a number of uses of this ability equal to 1 + your Charisma modifier. All these uses replenish on a long rest.</p>",
